sets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/bdd5395ed3d8568f4c335b2c218511e5.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/bdd5395ed3d8568f4c335b2c218511e5.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/bdd5395ed3d8568f4c335b2c218511e5.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face difficult bosses at the end of each biome!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>over 20 unique boss fights</strong>, including a challenging final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/8d7181e206c97ca0eb0dec7b6f5684e3.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/8d7181e206c97ca0eb0dec7b6f5684e3.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/8d7181e206c97ca0eb0dec7b6f5684e3.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on high risk and high reward challenges during your runs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game offers <strong>over 20 unique challenges</strong>. Destroy enemy forts, capture the flags, defeat waves of enemies, find a key to escape a room, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/1ee7582b055874ef47a44c62026427cb.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/1ee7582b055874ef47a44c62026427cb.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/1ee7582b055874ef47a44c62026427cb.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick from multiple unlockable characters classes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play <strong>more than 20 different character classes</strong>. Each with its unique ability and starting equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/1870ebd4c91028090473ba857e1aa551.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/1870ebd4c91028090473ba857e1aa551.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/1870ebd4c91028090473ba857e1aa551.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and repair powerful weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>over 100 unique weapons and spells</strong>, each upgradable through crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find blueprints, gather herbs, dig ores, and loot treasures to create potions, weapons, and spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a977a9c5d355bcbea70e401aecd24423.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a977a9c5d355bcbea70e401aecd24423.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a977a9c5d355bcbea70e401aecd24423.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete rooms, find loot, and equip yourself with powerful items!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkout <strong>more than 250 items in the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/f5b9e681796524e280229b450b2ce65f.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/f5b9e681796524e280229b450b2ce65f.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/f5b9e681796524e280229b450b2ce65f.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with various NPC Characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable characters and discover their stories. Buy and sell goods for gold, but beware - some <strong>decisions can have dire consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/e30deb0f6e7fcc4d60688fad65f96470.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/e30deb0f6e7fcc4d60688fad65f96470.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/e30deb0f6e7fcc4d60688fad65f96470.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore rich lore and hidden mysteries in depths of the Hollow Mine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into the lore, uncover all the mysteries, and complete the ultimate task: <strong>destroy the Weles Burden ring.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/c4acbfd2fe2b1bae588bb7c3797531c7.poster.avif?t=1752439002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/c4acbfd2fe2b1bae588bb7c3797531c7.webm?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/c4acbfd2fe2b1bae588bb7c3797531c7.mp4?t=1752439002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage unique enemies <strong>from 5 biomes</strong>, featuring <strong>over 90 procedurally generated rooms</strong>. <strong>Over 20 challenging boss fights</strong>, including the final boss. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ever-changing world with high replayability value and rich variety each run!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, get experience and pick from <strong>more than 100 unique abilities.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a destructive environment in rooms, using your pickaxe mine resources and dig up walls to flank enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Blueprints and construct your weapons and spells from scratch with resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct your own build with preferable play style, melee, range and magic spells!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover more than 100 weapons and spells,</strong> all upgradeable through crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize mining wagons, bombs, and biome-specific traps to crush foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover more than 250 items!</strong> Including equippable ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight over 20 unique and challenging boss fights including final boss throughout 5 biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play more than 20 unlockable character classes</strong> with unique abilities and starting gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy fast-paced runs in 40-minute</strong> or longer play sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rich lore and hidden mysteries in depths of the Hollow Mine!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various NPC Characters. Buy or sell goodies. <strong>Remember decisions can have bad consequences!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hollow Mine is an action roguelite that combines mining, crafting, and intense 2D top-down combat. Explore unpredictable, ever-changing mines, battle fierce enemy hordes, and confront tough bosses. Engage, die, learn, and repeat as you uncover new challenges with every run.",
